(Chapter Two: European History) Tj T*
(The Treaty of Versailles was signed on the twenty eighth of June) Tj T*
(nineteen nineteen in the Hall of Mirrors. It imposed reparations of) Tj T*
(one hundred thirty two billion gold marks on Germany and redrew the) Tj T*
(borders of central Europe. Article two hundred thirty one assigned) Tj T*
(responsibility for the war, a clause that became deeply resented.) Tj T*
